Usage: ldd [OPTION]... FILE...

Print PE import dependencies for Windows executables.

OPTIONS:
  -d, --data-relocs      process data relocations
  -r, --function-relocs  process data and function relocations
  -n, --name             print only imported DLL names
  -u, --unused           print unused direct dependencies
  -v, --verbose          print all information
      --help             display this help and exit
  -V, --version          output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
